SUMMARY:Undercover Critters
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require pre-registration. Register for this program for ages 8+\nWho’s hiding under cover? Join our investigative team to find out! We will head outside to check a couple transects of our cover boards and lift them carefully to see which reptiles\, amphibians\, and other critters are using them as homes. We’ll record what we find to add to the data set to track biodiversity. No experience needed\, just your curiosity! We will walk 1-2 miles on uneven surfaces. Long pants and closed-toed shoes are required.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/undercover-critters/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Collaborative Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
ORGANIZER;CN="Julie%20Hall":MAILTO:julie.hall@naturalsciences.org
